{"3038290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EXPEDITION TO THE BACKROOMS", "steam_appid": 3038290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/f559d1866b70a659663b37a3af61cf19.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/f559d1866b70a659663b37a3af61cf19.webm?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/f559d1866b70a659663b37a3af61cf19.mp4?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>EXPEDITION TO THE BACKROOMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPEDITION TO THE BACKROOMS is an atmospheric exploration game focused on wandering through quiet, unsettling environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the Backrooms internet horror phenomenon, the game takes players through strange and isolated spaces hidden beyond reality. Explore abandoned office areas, flooded complexes, and other unnatural environments connected by the endless maze of the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/a7b160626544b9aab160cb0283972f6d.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/a7b160626544b9aab160cb0283972f6d.webm?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/a7b160626544b9aab160cb0283972f6d.mp4?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNIQUE ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of large-scale locations with distinct visual styles, atmosphere and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area offers its own sense of scale, isolation, and mystery, ranging from familiar office spaces to surreal and impossible architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/77b4e5889bbf0b8126072cb7f312fed9.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/77b4e5889bbf0b8126072cb7f312fed9.webm?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/77b4e5889bbf0b8126072cb7f312fed9.mp4?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ATMOSPHERIC VISUALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with a strong focus on lighting, materials, scale, and immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience detailed liminal environments designed to feel quiet, believable, and deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/68a648116bf22fcc78c233c8bfcce075.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/68a648116bf22fcc78c233c8bfcce075.webm?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/68a648116bf22fcc78c233c8bfcce075.mp4?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ENCOUNTER ENTITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone inside the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features 3 entities with different behaviors. Some may ignore your presence, while others react to movement, sound, or exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/fbe1736ea08ed3073071a8d75c858b89.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/fbe1736ea08ed3073071a8d75c858b89.webm?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/fbe1736ea08ed3073071a8d75c858b89.mp4?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPEDITION STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as part of an PhaseSync research expedition investigating anomalous locations connected to the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover abandoned equipment, traces of previous expeditions, and evidence that something went wrong long before your arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/76ee3415c08b0a0f83e58f6cc0c465cb.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/76ee3415c08b0a0f83e58f6cc0c465cb.webm?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/76ee3415c08b0a0f83e58f6cc0c465cb.mp4?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Backrooms alone or together with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to navigate unfamiliar spaces, search for clues, and survive encounters inside the anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/f559d1866b70a659663b37a3af61cf19.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/f559d1866b70a659663b37a3af61cf19.webm?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/f559d1866b70a659663b37a3af61cf19.mp4?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>EXPEDITION TO THE BACKROOMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPEDITION TO THE BACKROOMS is an atmospheric exploration game focused on wandering through quiet, unsettling environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the Backrooms internet horror phenomenon, the game takes players through strange and isolated spaces hidden beyond reality. Explore abandoned office areas, flooded complexes, and other unnatural environments connected by the endless maze of the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/a7b160626544b9aab160cb0283972f6d.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/a7b160626544b9aab160cb0283972f6d.webm?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/a7b160626544b9aab160cb0283972f6d.mp4?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNIQUE ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of large-scale locations with distinct visual styles, atmosphere and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area offers its own sense of scale, isolation, and mystery, ranging from familiar office spaces to surreal and impossible architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/77b4e5889bbf0b8126072cb7f312fed9.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/77b4e5889bbf0b8126072cb7f312fed9.webm?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/77b4e5889bbf0b8126072cb7f312fed9.mp4?t=1787599103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ATMOSPHERIC VISUALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with a strong focus on lighting, materials, scale, and immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience detailed liminal environments designed to feel quiet, believable, and deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/68a648116bf22fcc78c233c8bfcce075.poster.avif?t=1787599103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038290/extras/